# armour/<body>/skirt_hauberk_back: the hauberk's lower courses and hem behind the legs (layer back).
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (FORGE-LIMBS envelope r1) T5-T6 skirt flare (STYLE_P2 29.3): `armour.t5` views facing D/U, 1 px more past the hips on the lower half; flared copies of the replace views go before them. Generated by FORGE-LIMBS flare.py.
use person
body woman
role overlay skirt.hauberk
layer back
anchor hip
keys hang
tags anyfacing
z 10

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key rest origin 10 -5 when !form-mail,armour.t5 replace
|..vwwwwwwwwwwwwvvv..
|..vyyyyyxxxxwwwwwv..
|vyyyyyyyyyxxxxxwwwwv
|vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv
regions
|...NNNNNNNNNNNNNN...
|....................
|.RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR.
|....................

